      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. Let me write the improved test. Key improvements:\n1. Remove unused `assertDecodeObject` helper and its associated dead imports/constants\n2. Extract a concise `encodeToString(byte[])` helper to eliminate the verbose cast+constructor pattern\n3. Split into two focused test methods (`singleByte` and `twoBytes`) \n4. Reuse the `bits` array with direct assignment instead of repeated `new byte[N]` allocations\n5. Introduce `allBitsSet` constant to name the all-1s sentinel valueThe improved test compiled successfully."
